Package: luci-app-netbird
Version: 1.1.4-1
Depends: libc, luci-base
Source: local
License: MIT
Section: luci
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 176
Maintainer: Maikel
Description: NetBird mesh VPN for GL.iNet routers: native admin-panel page (Applications > NetBird) plus LuCI pages.
 Installs/updates the official NetBird binary (checksum verified), runs it
 as a procd service, shows status and peers, and creates a firewall zone.
 Built for GL.iNet Mudi 7 (GL-E5800, OpenWrt 23.05) and other OpenWrt routers.
